{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/Logo.png?t=1741835238\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;Slime Survivors&quot; \u2013 Survive the Limitless Monster Onslaught!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As endless hordes of demons swarm like tidal waves, you\u2019ll become a hero of the Slime Kingdom, upgrading <strong>diverse weapons</strong> to forge instruments of carnage! Dodge through bullet-hell barrages, unleash dazzling ultimate skills to shred enemy waves, and experience an adrenaline-pumping roguelike survival frenzy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All you need to do: Move your character, aim at enemies, evade attacks, collect rewards, power up, and slaughter foes in style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/Slime_Survivors_2025-03-05_13-50-372025351415521.gif?t=1741835238\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/Slime_Survivors_2025-03-05_11-20-452025351429122.gif?t=1741835238\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953570/extras/Slime_Survivors_2025-03-05_11-20-452025351442364.gif?t=1741835238\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 <strong>Thrilling Combat Mastery</strong> \u25c6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A transformative weapon upgrade system turns your humble beginnings into apocalyptic god-slaying artillery! Every level-up brings explosive power growth\u2014witness the miracle of a nobody becoming an apocalyptic force!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u25c6 <strong>Push Your Limits</strong> \u25c6</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dodge! Strategize! Survive! Find loopholes in increasingly chaotic bullet-hell storms and break 